# The title's dialogs (Settings with a game setting toggled, Help,
# Achievements, Leaderboards), the mode select, a lesson played to its goal
# (Roll and move: one roll), the board list, the Album and News drawers,
# pause → Help → back to pause → Leave round, and back to the title.
until 300 City Fortune
frames 20
save title
click Settings
until 60 Accessibility & controls
frames 10
click Always show board list
frames 5
save settings
key Escape 1
frames 10
click Help
until 60 How to play
frames 10
save help
key Escape 1
frames 10
click Achievements
until 60 Master Curator
frames 10
key Escape 1
frames 10
click Leaderboards
until 60 No results yet
frames 10
click Close
frames 10
click Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Roll and move
until 120 This is your city circuit
frames 30
expect Album
save lesson
frames 5
click Roll
frames 3
key KeyC 1
frames 10
until 120 Lesson complete!
save lesson-done
click Got it
frames 10
click Album
until 60 Close album
frames 10
save album-drawer
click Close album
frames 10
click News
until 60 Close news
frames 10
expect Welcome to
click Close news
frames 10
key KeyP 1
until 60 Paused
frames 10
save pause
click Help
until 60 How to play
frames 10
expect Right now
key Escape 1
until 60 Leave round
frames 10
click Leave round
